<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<section>
	<h2>Policy</h2>
	<p>
		truckload.io is designed as a web application,
		<a href="https://truckload.io">https://truckload.io</a>, and the mobile iOS version utilizes the web app's
		backend for processing the loading calculations. truckload.io does not use any third-party analytics, advertising, or
		tracking services, nor does it store any data. For more information about the data transmitted between the app and 
		the backend, please see the <a href="../truckload-io-web/privacy.njk">privacy page for the web app</a>. 
	</p>
</section>

